%% 04 · Build phase — Author (validated, 3-minute shape) → Voice (+ extra languages) → Rehearsal → Bundle
flowchart TD
  N7["Since 2026-09-04: AUTHOR, DECK and FAQ run at Configure (before Align); BUILD = voice (narration + FAQ answers + filler lines) → rehearsal (scores the bank) → bundle (slides with audio joined by line id, timeline, fillers, faq, image map)"]:::data
  GO["POST /api/demos/id/build<br/>[FUNCTION] gate: all 6 approvals true"]:::fn
  AUTH["script draft (principles + PITCH_SHAPE + audience level)<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier · messages.parse]<br/>in: plan, registry, shots, images, brand, language, audience (+ previous script + instruction)<br/>out: ScriptOut · intro + outcome (fixed opening, signposted) + ≤3 proof + one 'more features' block + establish; lines {text, step, visual, fact_ids, card}; checkin = CONFIRM; deeper = technical detail; closing = advance"]:::agent
  VAL["grounding + pacing + plain-language validator<br/>[FUNCTION · author.validate]<br/>fact_ids ⊆ registry · visual ref exists · NUMBERISH/CLAIMISH text with no fact id → unverified · opening ≤ 115 words · role budgets intro 55 / outcome 60 / proof 60 / features 110 / establish 45 · route ≤ 480 words (≈3 min) · JARGON regex (kWh, IDC, amp, 15A, Nm…) in main narration for audience=everyday → issue"]:::fn
  ISS{"issues > 0?"}:::dec
  FIX["one repair pass<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier]<br/>in: draft + issue list · out: full script"]:::agent
  VAL2["re-validate<br/>[FUNCTION] remaining offenders stay unverified → excluded from voice & bundle, listed on Facts card"]:::fn
  IDS["assign stable line ids<br/>[FUNCTION]<br/>out: seg-L1.. plus closing ids"]:::fn
  VAUD["visual-proof audit<br/>[AGENT · Gemini 3.6 Flash]<br/>in: real uploaded pixels in batches ≤12 + every scripted line<br/>out: every image's visible features/limits + every line full/partial/none/not_visual"]:::agent
  VGATE["accept audit only when complete<br/>[FUNCTION · visuals.py]<br/>all line ids + all image refs required; full coverage may bind image<br/>partial/missing visible feature → no image → hero + cited card<br/>Gemini failure → conservative tag rules"]:::fn
  AUDIT["visual-audit.json<br/>[DATA]<br/>line reasons, image feature inventory, missing features, changes"]:::data
  SJ["script.json<br/>[DATA] visual refs + audit summary · version++"]:::data
  DPIC["one slide per segment · picture per slide<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.choose_image]<br/>tagged parts vs. the slide's words (+2 for the script's own pick); score ≥ 3 else the hero<br/>hero_open / intro / outcome / proof… / establish / closing / hero_close"]:::fn
  DCALL["titles + callouts<br/>[AGENT · Claude → Gemini → Runware text tier · deck.DeckOut]<br/>in: per slide its lines, fact ids and the PARTS on its picture; the registry<br/>out: ≤ 6-word title, ≤ 3 callouts of ≤ 8 words each citing fact ids and naming a listed part"]:::agent
  DVAL["the script-line rule on every callout<br/>[FUNCTION · author.ungrounded]<br/>uncited figure/claim, > 8 words, unlisted part → dropped; a slide left empty gets its own cited facts (claim: value)"]:::fn
  DLAY["label layout<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.place_callouts]<br/>part confidence ≥ 0.6 → anchor = box centre, label at the first of 8 spots that is inside the frame, off the part box and clear of other labels; otherwise → side panel. Never a guessed position"]:::fn
  DOVR["deck-overrides.json (from Align)<br/>[DATA] user-chosen picture / title / text / dragged label wins"]:::data
  DJ["deck.json<br/>[DATA] slides · version++ · method model|derived"]:::data
  PROV{"tts provider chain?<br/>[FUNCTION · voice.provider_chain]<br/>sarvam → gemini → gcloud → browser (no key)"}:::dec
  TTS["render every line (main language)<br/>[LIBRARY · Sarvam Bulbul v3 / Gemini TTS / Cloud TTS]<br/>cache key sha1(provider|voice|lang|text) → audio/*.wav|mp3<br/>VOICE_WORKERS=4 parallel (contextvars copied per task) · stop after 4 failures · circuit breaker: 401/402/403/quota trips a provider for 10 min → next in chain · failures traced"]:::data
  BROWSER["voice_provider=browser<br/>[term] player speaks with Web Speech"]:::term
  LANGS{"settings.languages<br/>has extra languages?"}:::dec
  TRANS["translate script per extra language<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier · translate.py · stage 'translate']<br/>in: segments/closing/intake text only · out: same ids, translated text · skipped when source digest unchanged → script.&lt;lang&gt;.json"]:::agent
  TTS2["render every translated line<br/>[LIBRARY · same chain, lang override]"]:::data
  QGEN["likely customer questions<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier]<br/>in: product, persona, concerns, fact claims · out: N questions (settings.rehearsal_questions, default 12)"]:::agent
  QA["answer each via qa.answer<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier + FUNCTION validator]<br/>see diagram 05 · one paid call per question"]:::agent
  COV["coverage = answered / N · gaps list<br/>[FUNCTION] → rehearsal.json"]:::fn
  SCORE["demo scorecard<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier · judge]<br/>in: plan + script · out: 10 criteria × 0-2, total, weakest 2-3 with fixes"]:::agent
  BUN["bundle.build<br/>[FUNCTION · bundle.py]<br/>in: demo, understanding, plan, script, deck (+ script.&lt;lang&gt;.json, deck.&lt;lang&gt;.json)<br/>out: bundle.json · slides with image URL, part boxes, callouts, and each line's audio joined by id; segments kept for the pre-slide player; CTAs, facts, languages + alt_languages; version++"]:::fn
  READY["status ready · SSE phase_done build · stage seconds recorded for Observability<br/>[term]"]:::term

  GO --> AUTH --> VAL --> ISS
  ISS -- "yes" --> FIX --> VAL2 --> IDS
  ISS -- "no" --> IDS
  IDS --> VAUD --> VGATE --> AUDIT --> SJ
  SJ --> DPIC --> DCALL --> DVAL --> DLAY --> DJ
  DOVR -.-> DLAY
  DJ --> PROV
  PROV -- "sarvam / gemini / gcloud" --> TTS --> LANGS
  PROV -- "browser" --> BROWSER --> QGEN
  LANGS -- "yes" --> TRANS --> TTS2 --> QGEN
  LANGS -- "no" --> QGEN
  QGEN --> QA --> COV --> SCORE --> BUN --> READY

  classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0b2a5b;
  classDef fn fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
  classDef dec fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef term fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827;
  classDef ask fill:#cffafe,stroke:#0891b2,color:#083344;
  classDef data fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#2a0a4a;
